<title>PERU: Peru's banks and markets closed on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Peru's banks and markets closed on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's banks and financial markets will remain closed on Tuesday during a national holiday to mark the 1879 Battle of Angamos during a war with Chile.</p>
<p>They will reopen for normal operations on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
